    },
    "content": [
     {
      "type": "text",
      "marks": [
       {
        "type": "bold"
       }
      ],
      "text": "What a ROS =:"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " an inventory of body systems, taken thru a series of questions, to identify signs or Sx the pt has now or has had."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
     "indLeft": 18,
     "indRight": 0,
     "indFirst": -18,
     "spaceBefore": 0,
     "spaceAfter": 0,
     "line": null,
     "align": "left",
     "shade": null,
     "borders": null,
     "marker": {
      "text": "•",
      "font": null,
      "marks": [],
      "tabPt": 18
     }
    },
    "content": [
     {
      "type": "text",
      "marks": [
       {
        "type": "bold"
       }
      ],
      "text": "The systems CMS recognizes:"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " constitutional Sx (eg, fever, wt loss); eyes; ears, nose, mouth and throat; cardiovasc; resp; GI; GU; MSK; integumentary (skin and/or breast); neurological; psychiatric; endo; hematologic/lymphatic; allergic/immunologic."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
     "indLeft": 18,
     "indRight": 0,
     "indFirst": -18,
     "spaceBefore": 0,
     "spaceAfter": 0,
     "line": null,
     "align": "left",
     "shade": null,
     "borders": null,
     "marker": {
      "text": "•",
      "font": null,
      "marks": [],
      "tabPt": 18
     }
    },
    "content": [
     {
      "type": "text",
      "marks": [
       {
        "type": "bold"
       }
      ],
      "text": "Problem-pertinent ROS:"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " ask about the system directly related to the problem(s) in the HPI, and document the pt's (+) responses and pertinent negatives for that system."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
     "indLeft": 18,
     "indRight": 0,
     "indFirst": -18,
     "spaceBefore": 0,
     "spaceAfter": 0,
     "line": null,
     "align": "left",
     "shade": null,
     "borders": null,
     "marker": {
      "text": "•",
      "font": null,
      "marks": [],
      "tabPt": 18
     }
    },
    "content": [
     {
      "type": "text",
      "marks": [
       {
        "type": "bold"
       }
      ],
      "text": "Extended ROS:"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " the problem's system plus a limited # of additional systems; document positives and pertinent negatives for two to nine systems."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
     "indLeft": 18,
     "indRight": 0,
     "indFirst": -18,
     "spaceBefore": 0,
     "spaceAfter": 0,
     "line": null,
     "align": "left",
     "shade": null,
     "borders": null,
     "marker": {
      "text": "•",
      "font": null,
      "marks": [],
      "tabPt": 18
     }
    },
    "content": [
     {
      "type": "text",
      "marks": [
       {
        "type": "bold"
       }
      ],
      "text": "Complete ROS:"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " the problem's system(s) plus all additional body systems, w ± ten systems reviewed. Document each system w (+) or pertinent (−) responses individually; for the rest, a note that all other systems are (−) = permissible. W.o that note, document ± ten systems individually."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
     "indLeft": 18,
     "indRight": 0,
     "indFirst": -18,
     "spaceBefore": 0,
     "spaceAfter": 0,
     "line": null,
     "align": "left",
     "shade": null,
     "borders": null,
     "marker": {
      "text": "•",
      "font": null,
      "marks": [],
      "tabPt": 18
     }
    },
    "content": [
     {
      "type": "text",
      "marks": [
       {
        "type": "bold"
       }
      ],
      "text": "Chief complaint:"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " a short statement of the Sx, problem, condition, dx or reason for the encounter, USU in the pt's own words. The record should clearly show it."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
     "indLeft": 18,
     "indRight": 0,
     "indFirst": -18,
     "spaceBefore": 0,
     "spaceAfter": 0,
     "line": null,
     "align": "left",
     "shade": null,
     "borders": null,
     "marker": {
      "text": "•",
      "font": null,
      "marks": [],
      "tabPt": 18
     }
    },
    "content": [
     {
      "type": "text",
      "marks": [
       {
        "type": "bold"
       }
      ],
      "text": "HPI elements:"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " location, quality, severity, duration, timing, context, modifying factors, and assoc Sx/S."
     }
    ]
   }
  ]
 },
